  "releaseNotes": "Release Notes:\n      - Opened the core for deeper user configuration across servers and sessions.\n      - Added per‑server control of static content, URL mapping, certificate paths, and freeze options.\n      - Removed hidden routing and intermediate layers to give users direct override control.\n      - Simplified session design so HTTP and WebSocket behavior can be fully customized.\n      - Reduced global state, improved clarity, and increased flexibility for multi‑server hosting.",
